<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Shop Studio</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      background: #fafaf8;
      color: #2d2d2d;
    }
    header {
      background: #fff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e4df;
      padding: 20px 40px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    header h1 {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #2d2d2d;
    }
    header span {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #888;
    }
    .hero {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 80px auto;
      padding: 0 40px;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #f0faf0;
      color: #3a7d44;
      border: 1px solid #c3e6c3;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }
    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: #555;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .features {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 80px;
      padding: 0 40px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .feature {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e8e4df;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .feature h3 {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    .feature p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #777;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .trust {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto 80px;
      padding: 32px 40px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e8e4df;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    .trust h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    .trust ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .trust li {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .trust li::before {
      content: '✓';
      color: #3a7d44;
      font-weight: 700;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #e8e4df;
      padding: 24px 40px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #aaa;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .features, .trust ul { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero h2 { font-size: 28px; }
      header, .hero, .features, .trust { padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Shop Studio</h1>
    <span>Personal Etsy seller tool</span>
  </header>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="badge">For Etsy Sellers</div>
    <h2>Your shop workflow,<br>all in one place.</h2>
    <p>
      Shop Studio is a private tool built for Etsy sellers who want
      full control over their shop. Create and update listings, write
      optimised titles and tags, track your sales, and respond to
      buyer messages — without switching between tabs.
    </p>
    <p>
      Connects securely to your Etsy shop via OAuth. Your data is
      stored securely and never shared with any third party.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="features">
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">📋</div>
      <h3>Listing Management</h3>
      <p>Create, edit and publish product listings directly to your Etsy shop. Keep your catalogue organised and up to date.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">🔍</div>
      <h3>Titles &amp; Tags</h3>
      <p>Write and refine listing titles, tags and descriptions to help your products reach the right buyers.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
      <h3>Sales Tracking</h3>
      <p>Read your shop's sales data to understand what's performing well and make informed decisions about your range.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">💬</div>
      <h3>Buyer Messages</h3>
      <p>Read and respond to buyer messages about their orders without breaking your workflow.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="trust" style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 80px;padding:32px 40px;">
    <h3>Built with privacy in mind</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>OAuth authentication — we never store your Etsy password</li>
      <li>Your shop data is never sold or shared</li>
      <li>Used solely for managing your own shop</li>
      <li>No third-party data sharing</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <footer>
    The term "Etsy" is a trademark of Etsy, Inc. Shop Studio uses the Etsy API but is not endorsed or certified by Etsy, Inc.
    <br>Shop Studio is an independent tool and is not affiliated with Etsy, Inc.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
